\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {7.4}{\ignorespaces Mean AUROC (left) and PR-AUC (right) by perturbation strategy, averaged across the three Pythia detectors, with the shaded band showing the min-to-max spread over detectors. Performance drops sharply under synonym substitution and recovers to or above the semantic control under statistically driven perturbations, showing that semantic coherence is not required for an effective curvature signal.}}{35}{figure.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:exp4_trend}{{7.4}{35}{Mean AUROC (left) and PR-AUC (right) by perturbation strategy, averaged across the three Pythia detectors, with the shaded band showing the min-to-max spread over detectors. Performance drops sharply under synonym substitution and recovers to or above the semantic control under statistically driven perturbations, showing that semantic coherence is not required for an effective curvature signal}{figure.caption.19}{}}
